Blood Pomegranates Of Worms: Once much and oh so pretty and very fresh all along the branches of mine own and all they'd produce is: dried worms, some of which shall never pass though given you to hold for just the pure of soul. One, when your choice comes with more for you to fight on these beasts no longer! The pain! The shame! All your wicked reasons. Pray you still remain of true light: Just. Be. Them. To. Them.
Nothing But One I Had It Chosen By Me...: When I met, she wore black with dark around the rim... One look into this soft glowing darkness within she brought to me;

